#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This simulation features a manual transmission vehicle using the closed-loop shifting controller.
#
#During a gear change, the throttle, clutch, and gear lever are controled using a Control: Clutch Shifting Timelines library.
#
#In this example, the clutch disengagement does not begin right when the shift command is given.  Instead, it is delayed by 0.1 seconds.
#
#VS Commands are used to control when data is written into the output files in order to focus on the control behavior during the shift.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

